    "Amounts do not identify downstream candidate, legislation, or causal policy effect; those connections require independent evidence.",
    "2026 figures stop on 2026-10-14 and are not final election totals.",
    "Donors outside the top 40 in a given cycle are absent, not known to have donated zero."
